{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"For securities a creation-unit purchaser has not yet delivered, the reviewed agreements may require **cash collateral of up to 115% of the value of those undelivered securities**. The percentage is applied to the **market value of the securities owed**, not the order’s total value or the cash component. **115% is not universal**: the agreement and fund’s procedures govern, and requirements may vary by fund or circumstances."}}
